<p>&larr; Back to <a href="http://opennj.net/otc">Open Textbook Collaborative&nbsp;Collection</a></p>

<h3>About Open Textbook Collaborative Training and Development</h3>

<p>This subcollection includes two classes, OER ABCs and the OpenNJ Repository System&nbsp; that were developed for the Open Textbook Collaborative (OTC) Career and Technical Education collection. These training resources and the&nbsp;OER developed for the OTC was funded by the&nbsp;<a href="https://www2.ed.gov/about/offices/list/ope/fipse/index.html">Fund for the Improvement of Postsecondary Education</a>&nbsp;(FIPSE) of the U.S. Department of Education for the Open Textbooks Pilot grant. The grant runs through 2023.&nbsp; For more information, go to our&nbsp;<a href="https://middlesexcc.libguides.com/OTCProject/home" target="_blank">Open Textbook Collaborative website.</a>&nbsp;</p>

